{"id": "0170", "language": "zh", "kind": "reference", "text": "腓利門書第一章第五節", "target": [57, 1, 5], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "duration_s": 2.3145, "sha256": "86e01d3d6b2f09e2a242d75425a3004529b53f87db9960c929ac9f3299e17e59", "transcript": "腓力门书第一章第五节", "decode_s": 1.1182380829704925, "cpu_s": 0.036958999999999964, "rtf": 0.4831445595033453, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 1, "units": 10, "reference": null, "reference_correct": false}
{"id": "0175", "language": "zh", "kind": "reference", "text": "請翻到雅各書第二章第三節", "target": [59, 2, 3], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "duration_s": 2.81375, "sha256": "3933dbbc077301cdbda053a512f9d1953b1403516da6ef47229956f14cfc3ce6", "transcript": "请翻到两个书第二章第三节。", "decode_s": 1.1498554999707267, "cpu_s": 0.045207, "rtf": 0.40865588626236393, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 2, "units": 12, "reference": null, "reference_correct": false}
{"id": "0180", "language": "zh", "kind": "reference", "text": "彼得後書第一章第一節", "target": [61, 1, 1], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "duration_s": 2.5451875, "sha256": "b41e4a8d3a29ca94e6ab48fde8961d77dd00edbbcf706761e052279f65d4e821", "transcript": "彼得后书第一章第一节", "decode_s": 1.0471479169791564, "cpu_s": 0.028400000000000425, "rtf": 0.41142270146272386, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 0, "units": 10, "reference": [61, 1, 1], "reference_correct": true}
{"id": "0185", "language": "zh", "kind": "reference", "text": "約翰一書第五章第五節", "target": [62, 5, 5], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "duration_s": 2.045, "sha256": "1824c3d28cf99f12239f95b9faa8f2300c3d4913ea960188274063fd55b86c32", "transcript": "约翰地书记五抓记五节", "decode_s": 0.96118779189419, "cpu_s": 0.014747000000000288, "rtf": 0.4700184801438582, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 4, "units": 10, "reference": null, "reference_correct": false}
{"id": "0190", "language": "zh", "kind": "reference", "text": "請翻到約翰三書第一章第三節", "target": [64, 1, 3], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "duration_s": 3.2595, "sha256": "5d248e54b3e513b0d609472610371fc7bf2d36f85132db3013a589fd24da8e70", "transcript": "请翻到约翰三书第一章第三节。", "decode_s": 1.096868040971458, "cpu_s": 0.03423799999999977, "rtf": 0.3365142018626961, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 0, "units": 13, "reference": [64, 1, 3], "reference_correct": true}
{"id": "0195", "language": "zh", "kind": "reference", "text": "啟示錄第一章第一節", "target": [66, 1, 1], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "duration_s": 2.234625, "sha256": "b2c10dc74046061d214e4743ef84376c02808baab9ec0cc2f9f44ee7c9e7e406", "transcript": "提示路基渣地一节", "decode_s": 1.1044684580992907, "cpu_s": 0.021667000000000325, "rtf": 0.4942522607145677, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 6, "units": 9, "reference": null, "reference_correct": false}
{"id": "0200", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我已將你的名指示他們，還要指示他們，使你所愛我的愛在他們裏面，我也在他們裏面。」", "target": [43, 17, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 7.6585, "sha256": "424a1e079b7762618fc5b88f6f03569ed749f15dd5cd84631b377b807cee2c8e", "transcript": "我已将你的名指示他们,还要指示他们,使你所爱我的爱在他们里面,我也在他们里面。", "decode_s": 1.0376407499425113, "cpu_s": 0.05796200000000029, "rtf": 0.13548877063948703, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 0, "units": 35, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0205", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "耶穌說：「狐狸有洞，天空的飛鳥有窩，只是人子沒有枕頭的地方。」", "target": [42, 9, 58], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.9879375, "sha256": "ac50e6bee5207129e498a63d97b4b2955b209be9f3546b948a4f18c399308f43", "transcript": "耶稣说,湖里有洞,天空的飞鸟有窝,只是人最没有枕头的地方。", "decode_s": 1.0764275409746915, "cpu_s": 0.06814900000000002, "rtf": 0.17976599471432217, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 3, "units": 25, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0210", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "並使他的兒子經火，又觀兆，用法術，立交鬼的和行巫術的，多行耶和華眼中看爲惡的事，惹動他的怒氣；", "target": [12, 21, 6], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 11.6820625, "sha256": "185eba70c75be61592970fd9a7951f4cdde6d961c3758e1e771ac78f2767cd64", "transcript": "并使他的儿子惊火,又观照,用法术,立交鬼的汉形巫术的,多形耶和华眼中看为恶的事,惹动他的怒气。", "decode_s": 1.2081931669963524, "cpu_s": 0.12041099999999982, "rtf": 0.10342293297920228, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 5, "units": 41, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0215", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我們出錢才得水喝； 我們的柴是人賣給我們的。", "target": [25, 5, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 3.7561875, "sha256": "d6d581a24a30285d7e618d4214660a87ea387e67cac5e7a16cf67d60df025fe3", "transcript": "我们出钱财的水和我们的柴是人卖给我们的。", "decode_s": 1.0135268750600517, "cpu_s": 0.03366200000000008, "rtf": 0.2698286161327281, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 3, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0220", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "不可露你兒婦的下體；她是你兒子的妻，不可露她的下體。", "target": [3, 18, 15], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.3570625, "sha256": "6c5c3d6b34682f9a1957506a739062d4b1ddca8feb8654a1d6d3c1dc8dde7ae8", "transcript": "不可录你儿父的下体,他是你儿子的妻,不可录他的下体。", "decode_s": 0.9164110419806093, "cpu_s": 0.04762000000000022, "rtf": 0.17106596049245446, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 5, "units": 23, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0225", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "說：「以掃若來擊殺這一隊，剩下的那一隊還可以逃避。」", "target": [1, 32, 8], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.8491875, "sha256": "dd8b36777f59b916bea82159fcf9101aaee55236caefc5cb874cdf2f8006dbf1", "transcript": "说,以扫若来击杀这一对,剩下的那一对还可以逃避。", "decode_s": 1.059168458916247, "cpu_s": 0.03855699999999995, "rtf": 0.18107958736427013, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 2, "units": 21, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0230", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "麥西生路低人、亞拿米人、利哈比人、拿弗土希人、", "target": [1, 10, 13], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.187875, "sha256": "fac345f1232a649e07e1ed0e1b81aadda177d7c74c0c9c782d567fc53608eb7b", "transcript": "麦西生路滴人,亚拿米人,利哈比人,拿福土西人。", "decode_s": 1.2291346250567585, "cpu_s": 0.04568899999999987, "rtf": 0.2369244873973946, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 3, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0235", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "一月之內，我除滅三個牧人，因爲我的心厭煩他們；他們的心也憎嫌我。", "target": [38, 11, 8], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 6.277, "sha256": "58b1431c312ed2ba3ed562dc447e2781db217ec01002ce70e9f19bbe208318d7", "transcript": "一月之内,我除灭三个牧人,因我的心养伞他们,他们的心也尊贤我。", "decode_s": 1.1768562910147011, "cpu_s": 0.059708000000000094, "rtf": 0.18748706245255714, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 5, "units": 28, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0240", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "七月二十三日，王遣散衆民；他們因見耶和華向大衛和所羅門與他民以色列所施的恩惠，就都心中喜樂，各歸各家去了。", "target": [14, 7, 10], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 13.3354375, "sha256": "e26bec90520c9bd6aa84b66b1223db41036e4b29b0be4e557317794c6835606d", "transcript": "7月23日,王潜散众明,他们应见耶和华向大魏和所罗门与他明以色列所施的恩惠,就都心中喜乐,各归各家去了。", "decode_s": 1.2523293750127777, "cpu_s": 0.08267900000000017, "rtf": 0.09390988297255173, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 5, "units": 47, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0245", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "惟恐多說，你嫌煩絮，只求你寬容聽我們說幾句話。", "target": [44, 24, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.8430625, "sha256": "00ef4e9f454443ba713334f6b9e4d9a103b4fd4941c7766ec1fd80094eaf1b45", "transcript": "唯恐多说,你嫌烦事,只求你宽容听我们说几句话。", "decode_s": 1.0487962499028072, "cpu_s": 0.05935900000000016, "rtf": 0.21655641443875795, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 2, "units": 20, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0250", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "所羅門在耶路撒冷作以色列衆人的王共四十年。", "target": [11, 11, 42], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.77875, "sha256": "d74109bdae85bf1ffaa5fc992e79800ef803e43b773470941f7a8a9e75e0905e", "transcript": "所罗门在耶路撒冷做以色列众人的王共四十年。", "decode_s": 1.051164458040148, "cpu_s": 0.06270799999999976, "rtf": 0.21996640503063522, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 1, "units": 20, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0255", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "主－我們的 神是憐憫饒恕人的，我們卻違背了他，", "target": [27, 9, 9], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.662875, "sha256": "b0fc20dbfb23b132ccaa91ac7984e79b15f3729b3ad2f0f570fbbf9fc15bdf3f", "transcript": "我们的神是怜悯饶恕人的,我们却违背了祂。", "decode_s": 0.9969284579856321, "cpu_s": 0.06008199999999997, "rtf": 0.21380124021888475, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 2, "units": 19, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0260", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "從那日起，我的僕人一半做工，一半拿槍、拿盾牌、拿弓、穿 鎧甲，官長都站在猶大衆人的後邊。", "target": [16, 4, 16], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 9.3191875, "sha256": "83b250bbda44fc0b81eb0c1eca1227460bc1c705a3dc4e45a2a1e45c7d17aad6", "transcript": "从那日起,我的仆人一半做工,一半拿枪,拿盾牌,拿弓,穿铠甲,官长都站在犹大众人的后边。", "decode_s": 1.0276451669633389, "cpu_s": 0.11307699999999965, "rtf": 0.11027197027244477, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 0, "units": 36, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0265", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "埃及中，無論是頭與尾， 棕枝與蘆葦，所做之工都不成就。", "target": [23, 19, 15], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 5.4676875, "sha256": "35b50527bede503d5e471d0703dcb15a95ed4d8974022841aec304b637ef7d86", "transcript": "在埃及中,无论是头与尾,宗之与卢尾,所作之功都不成就。", "decode_s": 1.0711123329820111, "cpu_s": 0.09833200000000009, "rtf": 0.1958986011877985, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 7, "units": 22, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0270", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "願憐恤、平安、慈愛多多地加給你們。", "target": [65, 1, 2], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.3475, "sha256": "a33bf219e5380b0db08f50eb101f6f6f7bf81195133ec96b7aaddfe9c41d6f76", "transcript": "愿连续、平安、慈爱多多地加紧你们。", "decode_s": 0.9833484999835491, "cpu_s": 0.03605299999999989, "rtf": 0.22618711903014355, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 3, "units": 14, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0275", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "你們不要自欺；濫交是敗壞善行。", "target": [46, 15, 33], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 2.889, "sha256": "8cb0ae1b49a7f7f3f048c169debb18155cfd4a5e9026bdd92fbc7aca36dd3795", "transcript": "你仍不要罪欺,乱交失败换上行。", "decode_s": 1.0393642080016434, "cpu_s": 0.04400700000000013, "rtf": 0.3597660809974536, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 6, "units": 13, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0280", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "並且因爲他是人子，就賜給他行審判的權柄。", "target": [43, 5, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 4.649375, "sha256": "eef60d763cc19b9b22428a36c5403745a26382eb0756534482552fadf7d682fe", "transcript": "并且因为他是人子,就赐给他行审判的权柄。", "decode_s": 1.0520157919963822, "cpu_s": 0.06033799999999978, "rtf": 0.22627036795190367, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 0, "units": 18, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0285", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "那獻供物的就要將細面伊法十分之一，並油一欣四分之一，調和作素祭，獻給耶和華。", "target": [4, 15, 4], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 150, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": false, "duration_s": 8.774375, "sha256": "547dbd6a18ccf53b7598322e95b8b32b45fa6b0ffe669274de85ffe7dc0f24dc", "transcript": "那献贡物罪就要将信念依法十分之一,并留意新四分之一,调和做素计,献给耶和华。", "decode_s": 1.2164989169687033, "cpu_s": 0.12502700000000022, "rtf": 0.13864223001281611, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 10, "units": 35, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0290", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "說假預言的先知，就是預言本心詭詐的先知，他們這樣存心要到幾時呢？ 他們各人將所做的夢對鄰舍述說，想要使我的百姓忘記我的名，正如他們列祖因巴力忘記我的名一樣。", "target": [24, 23, 26], "voice": "Meijia", "rate": 195, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 15.1954375, "sha256": "0f34e7a970e48f75cdbfe2b722548b91e0cd9e80afd278c12da95b23feb762b2", "transcript": "说假预言的先知,就是预言本心诡诈的先知,他们这样存心要到几时呢?他们个人将所做的梦对灵社树说,想要使我的百姓忘记我的名,正如他们列祖因巴利忘记我的名一样。正如他们列祖因巴利忘记我的名一样。", "decode_s": 1.16669445799198, "cpu_s": 0.23129500000000025, "rtf": 0.07677926074796991, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 21, "units": 73, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
{"id": "0295", "language": "zh", "kind": "quotation", "text": "我們要爲你編上金辮，鑲上銀釘。 〔新娘〕 王正坐席的時候， 我的哪噠香膏發出香味。", "target": [22, 1, 11], "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))", "rate": 175, "split": "calibration", "cross_verse": true, "duration_s": 7.5255625, "sha256": "b66706466c716444a2b8456c6eea8cb9e669531ac1e484ae6c86ce588a64ffd2", "transcript": "我们要你边上筋片,虾上一度。新娘花众做席的时候,我跟老大虾高发出香味。", "decode_s": 0.8718807500554249, "cpu_s": 0.07069599999999987, "rtf": 0.11585589117829063, "max_rss_bytes": 825982976, "edits": 15, "units": 32, "reference": null, "reference_correct": null}
